1
00:00:13,657 --> 00:00:24,054
We step into the quiet cold,
With no more stories to be told.

2
00:00:26,659 --> 00:00:36,922
I pull you deep into my chest,
Where both our aching spirits rest.

3
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:51,009
We stand inside the freezing air,
Without a word or whispered prayer.

4
00:00:52,068 --> 00:01:09,442
Two hearts that beat as one soft rhythm,
One silent hour to just be with them.

5
00:01:21,084 --> 00:01:31,786
My arms are wrapped around your frame,
No need to speak each other’s name.

6
00:01:34,286 --> 00:01:45,328
Our breathing falls into one beat,
Above the cold concrete beneath.

7
00:01:46,407 --> 00:01:59,158
We hold on tight, we keep our guard,
The world outside is cold and hard.

8
00:01:59,691 --> 00:02:16,879
We stand inside the freezing air,
Without a word or whispered prayer.

9
00:02:18,641 --> 00:02:29,323
Deep down we know this is the end,
The last true hour we can spend.

10
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:42,016
We hold this moment in our hands,
Where time forgets its shifting sands.

11
00:02:44,044 --> 00:02:56,636
Two hearts that beat as one soft rhythm,
One silent hour to just be with them.

12
00:02:57,123 --> 00:03:14,470
We hold on tight, we keep our guard,
The world outside is cold and hard.

13
00:03:32,490 --> 00:03:43,285
A gentle kiss, so soft and slow,
Before we have to let it go.

14
00:03:45,625 --> 00:03:56,414
No promise made, no tear to fall,
Just you and me against it all.

15
00:03:58,152 --> 00:04:10,265
We stand inside the freezing air,
Without a word or whispered prayer.

